umts-hnb
========

An open-source SDR-based UMTS Home NodeB (HNB) that connects to a 3GPP-standard
HNB-GW over the Iuh interface (TS 25.467).

Origin
------

This project began as a port of OpenBTS-UMTS
<https://github.com/RangeNetworks/OpenBTS-UMTS>, an AGPLv3 UMTS base-station
implementation by Range Networks, Inc. and contributors. The application in
this repository is a Rust workspace. No OpenBTS-UMTS source files are
included.

"OpenBTS" is a registered trademark of Range Networks, Inc. This project does
not use the OpenBTS name.

